{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e5b70911-1511-8d34-afcc-c3b4c7bcf608",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T10:32:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Uh, I was expecting a machine, to be honest. I figured I'd get a menu and press four or something. You caught me off guard, a real human."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you've got a person. Mondays after a holiday week, we're a little thin, but I'm here. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I got a cat problem. Not a cat, a bunch of cats. Feral ones, living back by the dumpsters behind my building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Let me make sure I have this right. A group of stray cats, near the dumpsters. Where is that, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:26:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "373 Kingston Avenue. Up the Historic Hill, kind of. The dumpsters are around the back, by the lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three seventy-three Kingston Avenue. Got it. And how many cats are we talking about, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I count five, sometimes six. Depends on the morning. There's one big orange guy, a tomcat, he's huge, maybe fifteen pounds, looks like a loaf of bread with legs. Then a couple of gray tabbies, smaller, and a skinny black one that runs the second you open the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:27:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so one large orange, two gray tabbies, one black, maybe a couple more. Let me write that down slowly. Orange, large. Gray, two. Black, thin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:27:28-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. And look, I'm not saying hurt them. I'm not that guy. But they get into the trash, the bags are all torn open, there's chicken bones all over the lot. I go out in the morning and it's like a crime scene."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. And is somebody feeding them, do you know? Or are they just getting into the garbage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little of both, I think. Somebody put a bowl out back in the fall. I don't know who. I wasn't gonna go knocking on doors asking whose bowl it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:28:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Have you seen any of them look sick or hurt? Limping, eyes crusted, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The black one maybe has a bad ear. Torn up, the edge of it. Otherwise they look okay. Fat, honestly. The orange one's definitely not missing any meals."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:28:31-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll be honest with you, I take the report here and it goes over to animal control. I can't tell you exactly what they'll do. Sometimes they set traps, sometimes they connect with a group that handles feral colonies. It varies."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. So somebody's gonna call me back, or what? Because I've been putting up with this since like Thanksgiving."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put your number on the report so they can reach you. Can you give me a good callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-four. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Julio Figueroa. F-I-G-U-E-R-O-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Figueroa. Julio with a J?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, J-U-L-I-O. Like the month, but with an O instead of a Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Now, one more thing. Is it your building, or do you rent? The landlord or whoever owns the dumpsters might need to be told too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. The landlord's a, uh, let's say hands-off type. Dumpsters are his. Lids don't even close right. One of them's got a broken hinge since October."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that the lids aren't closing. That may be something the city looks at separately. Sometimes the answer is just securing the trash so there's nothing to draw them in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:30:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I figured. I'm just tired of dealing with it. I came to the bubbler, I mean, the, the, uh, never mind. Wrong thing. I'm just saying, it's every morning, I'm out there with a broom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'm putting it all in. Large orange male, two gray tabbies, a black one with a torn ear, near the dumpsters behind 373 Kingston. Trash torn open. Dumpster lid broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. That's the whole picture."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Do you know roughly when they're most active? Morning, night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early. Like six, six-thirty, when it's still dark. And they're back around dusk. Four-thirty, this time of year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early morning and dusk. That will help them if they come out to set a trap. I'd tell you not to try to catch any yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no. No no. That orange guy would take my arm off. I'm not going near him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:31:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wise. Alright, Mr. Figueroa, the report is in. Animal control should reach out, probably within a few business days, though with the holiday week it might run a bit longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A few days, fine. And if nobody calls?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then call back here and tell whoever answers you already made a report today, the twenty-ninth. They can look it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:31:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The twenty-ninth. Okay. Thanks, Owen. I appreciate you actually picking up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:31:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to. Take care, and have a good rest of your Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
